  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you activate your Rage, you gain one of the following options of your choice.</p><p><strong>Falcon.</strong> While your Rage is active, you have a Fly Speed equal to your Speed if you aren't wearing any armor.</p><p><strong>Lion.</strong> While your Rage is active, your enemies within 5 feet of you have Disadvantage on attack rolls against targets other than you or another Barbarian who has this option active.</p><p><strong>Ram.</strong> While your Rage is active, you can give a Large or smaller creature the Prone condition when you hit it with a melee attack.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-erpVsJorJiCvMso7\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the <em>Falcon</em> effect while you rage with that option and wear no armor.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
